# **All in One Accessibility® - Wagtail Accessibility Plugin**

## **Free WCAG, ADA, EAA accessibility plugin for Wagtail websites!**

This [Free Wagtail accessibility plugin](https://www.skynettechnologies.com/wagtail-ada-widget) - adds an accessible experience for users with visual, auditory, motor, or cognitive disabilities. It supports assistive technologies, offers customizable updates, and enhances overall usability according to WCAG 2.1, 2.2, ADA, EAA, Section 508, France RGAA, California Unruh, European EAA EN 301 549, UK Equality Act, Spain UNE 139803:2012, Australian DDA, Israeli Standard 5568, Ontario AODA, Canada ACA, German BITV, Brazilian Inclusion Law (LBI 13.146/2015), JIS X 8341 (Japan), Italian Stanca Act, Indian RPwD Act, Switzerland DDA and other [accessibility standards](https://www.skynettechnologies.com/accessibility-standards).

This [free accessibility widget](https://www.skynettechnologies.com/free-website-accessibility-widget) quickly adds essential accessibility features through a lightweight, easy to install solution that supports inclusive browsing and compliance efforts.

**Core Features - What you get with free accessibility Wagtail widget?**

- Auto-detect language
- Supports 190+ multi-languages.
- Skip to Navigation / Content / Footer
- Content Adjustment Options
- Visual & Color Adjustments
- Dynamic free Wagtail accessibility module customization including colors, size, icon, and position
- Reading mask
- Accessibility statement

Explore the [free accessibility widget features guide](https://www.skynettechnologies.com/sites/default/files/Free-Accessibility-Widget-Features-Guide.pdf).

**This free accessibility Wagtail plugin is a great fit for:**

- Businesses, developers, agencies, content teams, ecommerce brands, educational institutions, and public-facing organizations using Wagtail who want to improve WCAG accessibility, usability, and user experience quickly without complex development.

**Why select free Wagtail WCAG accessibility module - All in One Accessibility?**

- Supports alignment with global accessibility standards
- Improves usability for users with visual, cognitive, and motor impairments.
- Integrates smoothly with most Wagtail site setups.
- Supports 190 plus multi languages and multisite for global accessibility reach.
- Available at no cost for core accessibility features.

### **Version Compatibility**

This package supports the following combinations of Python, Django, and Wagtail versions:

| Requirement    | Supported Versions                                          |
|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
| Python         | 3.10, 3.11, 3.12, 3.13, 3.14                                  |
| Django         | 4.2, 5.0, 5.1, 5.2, 6.0                                       |
| Wagtail        | 5.2, 6.0, 6.1, 6.2, 6.3, 6.4, 7.0, 7.1, 7.2, 7.3, 7.4          |
| Plugin Version | 2.2.3                                                         |

`install_requires` is intentionally kept wide (`Django>=4.2,<6.1`,
`wagtail>=5.2,<8.0`) so this plugin doesn't block `pip`'s resolver from
picking whatever current Django/Wagtail combination the rest of your
project needs. Not every Django/Wagtail pair in that range is compatible
with *each other* though - Wagtail dropped Django 4.2 support as of
Wagtail 7.4, and Django 6.0 requires Python 3.12+. Match the pair to
[Wagtail's own compatible Django/Python table](https://docs.wagtail.org/en/stable/releases/upgrading.html#compatible-django-python-versions),
reproduced here for the versions this plugin has been tested against:

#### Python 3.13 / 3.14
- **Django 6.0**: Compatible with **Wagtail 7.4, 7.3, 7.2**
- **Django 5.2**: Compatible with **Wagtail 7.4, 7.3, 7.2, 7.1, 7.0**
- **Django 5.1**: Compatible with **Wagtail 7.2, 6.4, 6.3, 6.2, 6.1, 6.0**

#### Python 3.10 / 3.11
- **Django 5.2**: Compatible with **Wagtail 7.4, 7.3, 7.2, 7.1, 7.0**
- **Django 5.1**: Compatible with **Wagtail 7.2, 6.4, 6.3, 6.2, 6.1, 6.0**
- **Django 4.2**: Compatible with **Wagtail 7.3, 7.2, 7.1, 7.0, 6.4, 6.3, 6.2, 6.1, 6.0, 5.2**

> **Notes:**
> - Django 6.0 requires Python 3.12 or higher, and (as of Wagtail 7.4)
>   also requires dropping Django 4.2 - if you're on Wagtail 7.4+, use
>   Django 5.2 or 6.0.
> - Wagtail 8.0 is still in development at the time of writing and isn't
>   pinned to yet; once released, bump the upper bound in your own
>   project once you've verified compatibility.


